                <pb facs="0134" n="64" xml:id="pg64"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">724.3415/3589: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Minister in Bolivia</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                        >Des Portes</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of
                    State</hi></head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps">La
                                Paz</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1934-03-05T16:00:00-04:00">March 5, 1934—4
                        p.m.</date><lb/>[Received 4:17 p.m.]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>18. Foreign Minister Calvo has tendered resignation because of disagreement
                    regarding reply to peace proposal which may be made tonight.</p>
                <p>He desires this kept confidential presumably hoping for rejection resignation and
                    furtherance his peace efforts.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Des Portes</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
